  "description": "English Graffiti is a bold and expressive display font inspired by classic street art and urban graffiti culture. With its hand-drawn brush strokes, slightly rough edges, and playful character shapes, this font captures the raw energy of wall tags, street murals, and underground art scenes. The organic flow and irregular detailing give it an authentic handmade feel, making it perfect for creative projects that need attitude and personality. Whether you’re designing posters, streetwear branding, music covers, social media graphics, or bold headlines, English Graffiti delivers a strong urban vibe.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>English Graffiti is a bold and expressive display font inspired by classic street art and urban graffiti culture. With its hand-drawn brush strokes, slightly rough edges, and playful character shapes, this font captures the raw energy of wall tags, street murals, and underground art scenes. The organic flow and irregular detailing give it an authentic handmade feel, making it perfect for creative projects that need attitude and personality. Whether you’re designing posters, streetwear branding, music covers, social media graphics, or bold headlines, English Graffiti delivers a strong urban vibe.</p>",
